                <pb facs="0781" n="693" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg693"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Dudley.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-05-07"><hi rendition="#italic">May 7,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Convey to the Government the assurances of the sincere sympathy with which the
                    President and the people of the United States have heard of the death of
                    President Candamo.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
